extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 4: Africa, printed 60-61 (cache p061-p062). The brief gave printed 60-62; printed 62 (cache p063) is the Ramen entry and holds nothing of the phoenixi, so source_book cites 60-61. The stat block on printed 61 was rendered and agrees with the text layer on every number. The Minions of the Gods intro (printed 59-60) states no rule for these races beyond calling them optional player characters who are likely aberrations from their norm, and barring only the Jinn as a player character. || XP: the Necromancer & Phoenixi ladder on printed 160, confirmed on a render and identical to the necromancer''s stored xp_table, copied from it: lower bounds 0 / 2,201 / 4,401 / 8,801 / 17,601 / 27,701 / 37,801 / 53,901 / 75,101 / 100,201 / 140,301 / 200,401 / 250,501 / 300,601 / 350,921. Level 15 is printed as 350,921-425,800 although level 14 ends at 350,700, so 350,921 is stored as printed rather than 350,701 - a book anomaly, as on the necromancer. || POOLS: 6D6x10 M.D.C. is the creature''s own body, stated outright with no ''plus O.C.C.'' clause, so it is mdc_base and no men_of_arms line is carried. No hit points or S.D.C. are printed. P.P.E. 3D4x100 +10 per level, I.S.P. 2D4x100 +10 per level, as printed. The extra 20 M.D.C. per level while ablaze is conditional and is prose. || The race page prints its own skill list and no O.C.C., so the R.C.C. skills and five secondary skills are stored; no related skills are printed and none are stored. || PSIONICS: telepathy, pyrokinesis and all healing and physical psi-powers, granted by name as a master psionic (pyrokinesis is a Super power). All Healing and Physical rows were taken from the live catalog on 2026-09-26, EXCLUDING the five filed under another game system (heroes-unlimited or nightbane: Calm Rage, Induce Pain, Wound Transfer, Ectoplasmic Arm, Resist Cold); Attack Disease and Transfer I.S.P. (Palladium Fantasy source, system unset) are included. A power added to those categories later is not granted automatically. || MAGIC: ''all fire magic spells'' is read as the 52 warlock Fire: elemental rows in the catalog (the Dragons and Gods write-up of the same creature says all fire elemental spells), plus Mystic Portal, Dimensional Portal and Close Rift, granted outright; spells_starting 0. || BONUSES: +2 initiative; +20% save vs coma/death as coma_death_pct; +2 vs all foreign chemicals as toxins_poisons 2 and harmful_drugs 2. Horror Factor 10; the +3 while burning is conditional prose. || SKILLS: basic and advanced math are Mathematics: Basic and Mathematics: Advanced 45+30; Astronomy 25+10; Land Navigation 36+20; Navigation 40+20; Wilderness Survival 30+10; Intelligence 32+10; reads and speaks Dragonese is Language: Dragonese 50+20 and Literacy: Dragonese/Elven 30+20; Gobblely 50+20. Two ancient W.P. and one modern W.P. are W.P. choices (the catalog does not split them). The additional Earth language is a Language: Other pick at base. Hand to Hand: Expert with no printed upgrade price, so no hand_to_hand block. Secondary skills: five from every category except Electrical, Mechanical, Medical and Pilot (Piloting); Pilot Related is kept since the book names piloting, not pilot-related. || No starting money and no equipment are printed; none stored. The flight speed 3D4x10 has no field and is a natural ability. The group size (1D4+2), habitat, allies and enemies are lore."
